    {
      "sport": "NFL",
      "family": "player props (before 2026-09-20) — unresolved names only",
      "reason": "Week 1 and Week 2 Thursday props come from the week reconciliation through an exact roster crosswalk (latest capture before kickoff, unique full name on the team). A row whose name matches no one, or several people, on that roster is left out rather than guessed."
