      "sport": "NFL",
      "family": "nfl_score_shape",
      "reason": "Key-number, tie, overtime and exact-score chances are published, but the file is overwritten on every run, so no frozen pre-kickoff copy exists to grade (only git history). Overtime cannot be settled at all yet: no captured result records whether a game went to overtime. Needs a write-once pre-kickoff receipt first."
    },
