      "sport": "MLB",
      "family": "player-prop leans",
      "reason": "Every MLB prop market is DEMOTED to market context (RESEARCH), so it is not public forecast history."
    },
    {
      "sport": "EPL",
      "family": "double chance",
      "reason": "Not a separate observation: each double-chance number is exactly 1 − one 1X2 class, so it is already measured inside the 1X2 family (its Brier terms are the 1X2 Brier's). Counting it again would score the same forecast twice."
    },
